    <code code="18776-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Plan of care note"/>
    <title>Plan of Treatment</title>
    <text><list><item>Medication: stopped, Varenicline 0.5 mg oral tablet, one tablet daily for three days, then one tablet twice daily [S]</item><item>Medication: started, Varenicline 1 mg oral tablet, one tablet twice daily [S]</item><item>Medication: continued without change, Acetaminophen 160 mg/5 mL oral solution, 20 mL (640 mg) every 6 hours as needed for throat pain [S]</item><item>Medication: continued without change, Lidocaine viscous 2% solution, 15 mL swish and spit up to every 3 hours as needed for throat pain [S]</item><item>Goal: Tissue diagnosis within two weeks of the first visit. Outcome by 1884-07-21: Biopsy at the otolaryngology visit two weeks after presentation [S]</item><item>Goal: Stop all tobacco use before treatment begins. In progress; target 1884-08-04 [S]</item><item>Goal: Limit weight loss to less than 10% of baseline weight through treatment. In progress; target 1884-10-22 [S]</item><item>Goal: Keep throat pain at 4 or below on the 0-10 scale most days. In progress; target 1884-10-22 [S]</item><item>Continue the care plan agreed on 1884-07-07 [S]</item><item>Next visit 1884-08-04: primary care visit after staging to coordinate nutrition, dental care, tobacco cessation, and symptom control before treatment [S]</item></list></text>

  </section>
